  "description": "Reid Viper 20 | 20 inch kids' bike\nLightweight, fast and built for adventure, the Reid Viper 20\" Kids' Bike is the perfect first big bike for children aged 6–9 years. Designed for everyday riding, it combines kid-specific geometry and components with durable construction for confident, comfortable cycling.\nThe 7-speed drivetrain gives young riders a wider range of gears, making it easier to tackle different terrain and build confidence as their riding develops. Kid-specific geometry and components provide a comfortable fit, while reliable alloy components are built to handle the knocks and bumps of everyday adventures.\nWhether they're riding around the neighbourhood, heading to the park or exploring local trails with the family, the Viper 20\" kids bike is designed to keep up with growing riders and their sense of adventure.\nBuilt to withstand the everyday bumps and scrapes that come with kids' cycling, the Viper 20\" kids' bike gives young riders the freedom to explore while providing parents with a durable and dependable kids' bike.\nWho is the Viper 20 for?\nThe Viper 20\" Kids' Bike is ideal for:\n\n6–9 year olds ready for their first big bike\nYoung riders developing confidence on two wheels\nChildren ready to progress to multi-speed gearing\nRiders learning to tackle different terrain and longer adventures\nParents looking for a lightweight, durable kids' bike\nEveryday adventures around the neighbourhood, park and local trails\n\nFind the right fit\nChoosing the right bike size helps your child ride comfortably, confidently and safely. Use our Kids' Bike Size Guide by clicking the tab above to find the right Reid bike based on your child's height and age.",
